WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.127 --> 00:00:05.172
- If you're going to make something,

00:00:05.255 --> 00:00:07.299
it's part of a story...

00:00:08.759 --> 00:00:12.304
that started before you
came in contact with the materials,

00:00:12.387 --> 00:00:14.932
and will continue long after.

00:00:17.976 --> 00:00:22.064
- Jonathan's autism made me
think why I'm building this house.

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:25.609
He taught me responsibility.

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:29.196
- I was investing in my block.

00:00:30.948 --> 00:00:33.617
I was investing in my life.

00:00:35.619 --> 00:00:38.622
- There is an alternative way to live.

00:00:40.249 --> 00:00:41.917
- We are trying to use 3D printing

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.211
to show that homelessness
is a solvable problem.

00:00:44.294 --> 00:00:46.964
- And now we're in the business
of community building.

00:00:50.342 --> 00:00:51.969
We're here to change things.

00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:54.137
We're here to
make things different.

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:57.975
- There's probably a good reason why
they've always made a door like that,

00:00:58.058 --> 00:01:00.310
why that's usually the way it is.

00:01:00.394 --> 00:01:02.437
But... what if it wasn't?

00:01:06.775 --> 00:01:10.821
- Some individuals,
instead of asking "Why?",

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:12.489
ask, "Why not?"

00:01:13.365 --> 00:01:15.492
- If you can build
castles out of grass,

00:01:15.576 --> 00:01:16.743
what else can you do?

00:01:18.287 --> 00:01:20.289
- Home's built out of recycled
materials...

00:01:21.707 --> 00:01:23.834
will be contributing
rather than taking.

00:01:25.419 --> 00:01:27.379
- I don't know
if I can change the world...

00:01:28.714 --> 00:01:30.966
but I know I can change my world.

00:01:33.051 --> 00:01:37.431
- One of the unexpected byproducts
of believing in my neighborhood

00:01:37.514 --> 00:01:42.060
is that it's allowed me
to feel safe, free...

00:01:42.811 --> 00:01:44.271
and home.

